TITLE Calcite precipitation during equilibration with minerals and gas phase
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite    0  0
    Gypsum     0  0
    Aragonite  0  0

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 25
    -pressure 1
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -totals Ca C S(6) S(-2)
USER_PUNCH
    -headings dCalcite
    10 PUNCH EQUI_DELTA("Calcite")
END
